[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SRS015
TITLE: Request and fly the option, touch-and-go, and stop-and-go
STATEMENT: >>>
The aircraft shall request the option, touch-and-go, or stop-and-go and shall read back the matching clearance with the runway and the call sign last. Touch-and-go shall touch and become airborne again. Stop-and-go shall land, slow, and then roll for takeoff. A cleared-for-the-option clearance shall fly the configured choice, and low approach shall descend only to the configured height above the field and then climb without landing. A landing clearance shall full-stop. Acceptance is a touch-and-go that reaches the surface and rolls again, a stop-and-go that slows below 5 knots and then accelerates, and a low approach that stays at or above 150 feet.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The option outcome is configured so the flight is repeatable.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
